export const GENRES=['미분류','록','팝','재즈','클래식','힙합 / 랩','R&B / 소울','전자음악','포크 / 컨트리','월드뮤직','종교음악','기타'];
export const normalize=s=>String(s??'').normalize('NFKC').toLowerCase().replace(/[\s\p{P}\p{S}]/gu,'');
export function genreOf(album,artists){return album.genre_mode==='override'?(album.genre||'미분류'):(artists.find(a=>normalize(a.name)===normalize(album.artist))?.genre||'미분류');}
export function duplicateGroups(albums){const groups=new Map();for(const a of albums){const key=normalize(a.artist)+'|'+normalize(a.title);if(!normalize(a.title)||!normalize(a.artist))continue;const arr=groups.get(key)||[];arr.push(a);groups.set(key,arr);}return [...groups.values()].filter(g=>g.length>1);}
export function fingerprintEqual(a,b){const x=(a.tracks||[]).map(t=>t.sha256).filter(Boolean).sort(),y=(b.tracks||[]).map(t=>t.sha256).filter(Boolean).sort();return x.length>0&&x.length===(a.tracks||[]).length&&y.length===(b.tracks||[]).length&&x.length===y.length&&x.every((v,i)=>v===y[i]);}
export function mergeScan(existing,incoming){if(!existing)return incoming;const result={...existing};const protectedFields=existing.manual_fields||[];for(const [k,v] of Object.entries(incoming)){if(['id','created_at','manual_fields','sources','notes','genre','genre_mode','reviewed','favorite'].includes(k)||protectedFields.includes(k))continue;if(v!==null&&v!==undefined&&v!=='')result[k]=v;}result.sources=[...(existing.sources||[]),...(incoming.sources||[])].filter((s,i,arr)=>arr.findIndex(x=>JSON.stringify(x)===JSON.stringify(s))===i);return result;}
export function validateManifest(m){if(!m||m.schema_version!==1||!Array.isArray(m.albums))throw Error('지원하지 않는 목록입니다. 스캐너가 생성한 schema_version 1 JSON을 선택하세요.');if(m.artists!==undefined&&(!Array.isArray(m.artists)||m.artists.some(a=>!a||typeof a.name!=='string'||!a.name.trim()||typeof a.genre!=='string')))throw Error('아티스트 정보 형식이 올바르지 않습니다.');if(m.albums.length>50000)throw Error('한 번에 50,000개까지 등록할 수 있습니다. 폴더별로 나누어 스캔하세요.');for(const a of m.albums){if(!a||typeof a.source_id!=='string'||!a.source_id||typeof a.title!=='string'||!a.title||typeof a.artist!=='string'||!Array.isArray(a.tracks))throw Error('앨범 정보 형식이 올바르지 않습니다.');if(a.thumbnail&&!/^data:image\/(jpeg|png|webp);base64,[A-Za-z0-9+/=]+$/.test(a.thumbnail))throw Error('잘못된 커버 데이터입니다.');}return m;}
export function makeAlbum(raw){return {...raw,id:raw.id||crypto.randomUUID(),created_at:raw.created_at||new Date().toISOString(),genre_mode:raw.genre_mode||'inherit',genre:raw.genre||'',notes:raw.notes||'',manual_fields:raw.manual_fields||[],sources:raw.sources||[],reviewed:raw.reviewed||false,tracks:raw.tracks||[],styles:raw.styles||[],attachments:raw.attachments||[]};}
export function validateConfig(url,key){let u;try{u=new URL(url);}catch{throw Error('Supabase 프로젝트 URL을 확인하세요.');}if(u.protocol!=='https:'||u.username||u.password||u.search||u.hash||u.pathname!=='/'||!u.hostname.endsWith('.supabase.co'))throw Error('https://프로젝트ID.supabase.co 형식의 URL을 입력하세요.');if(key.startsWith('sb_secret_'))throw Error('관리자 키는 사용할 수 없습니다. Publishable key만 입력하세요.');if(!key.startsWith('sb_publishable_')){try{const b=key.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g,'+').replace(/_/g,'/');const data=JSON.parse(atob(b));if(data.role!=='anon')throw Error();}catch{throw Error('Publishable key 또는 anon 공개 키가 필요합니다. service_role 키는 사용하지 않습니다.');}}return {url:u.origin,key};}
export function demo(){const artists=[{name:'ABBA',genre:'팝'},{name:'10cm',genre:'포크 / 컨트리'},{name:'Gavy NJ',genre:'R&B / 소울'},{name:'Claudio Abbado',genre:'클래식'},{name:'Antonio Carlos Jobim',genre:'재즈'}];const rows=[['ABBA','Ring Ring','1973','1988','Swedish Polar','POLCD-242','FLAC','CUE + 단일 음원'],['ABBA','Ring Ring','1973','1990','Polydor','843 642-2','', '판본 확인 필요'],['ABBA','Waterloo','1974','1992','Polydor K.K. Japan','POCP-2202','','판본 확인 필요'],['10cm','5.3 Gradation','2022','','','','FLAC','24bit / 96kHz · 폴더 표기'],['10cm','1.0','2011','','','','FLAC','16bit / 44.1kHz · 폴더 표기'],['Gavy NJ','이쁘네요','2012','','','','FLAC','트랙별 음원'],['Claudio Abbado','Brahms: Hungarian Dances','','','','','FLAC','55CD 박스 세트의 첫 디스크'],['Antonio Carlos Jobim','Wave','1967','','','','OGG','판본 확인 필요']];return {artists,albums:rows.map((r,i)=>makeAlbum({id:'demo-'+i,source_id:'demo-'+i,artist:r[0],title:r[1],original_year:r[2],release_year:r[3],label:r[4],catalog_number:r[5],format:r[6],edition:r[7],path:'체험 데이터 — 실제 경로는 스캔 후 연결됩니다.',sources:[{type:'folder',text:'공유폴더 표본 조사. 장르는 화면 체험용이며 미확정.'}],reviewed:false,tracks:[],color:['#d3e0e5','#dddeda','#d7dfe9','#e0d9d0','#d8e2df','#d9d5e4','#d6dee3','#d6dfd0'][i]}))};}

export function artistsForImport(manifest, existingArtists){
 const result=[];
 const known=new Set(existingArtists.map(a=>normalize(a.name)));
 for(const artist of [...(manifest.artists||[]),...manifest.albums.map(a=>({name:a.artist,genre:'미분류'}))]){
  const key=normalize(artist.name);
  if(!known.has(key)){result.push({name:artist.name,genre:artist.genre});known.add(key);}
 }
 return result;
}
